#
# Default-deny Docker build context. Only paths needed for
#   cargo build/clippy --locked --features cuda
# are re-included. Prevents host credentials (actions-runner, .env, keys)
# and unrelated trees from being sent via `COPY . .`.

# Deny everything first
*

# Required crate inputs
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!build.rs
!src
!src/**
!cu
!cu/**

# Optional docs/license (harmless; useful for image inspection)
!LICENSE-MIT
!LICENSE-APACHE
!README.md

# Declared [[example]] in Cargo.toml — required for cargo parse
!examples
!examples/**

